WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 15]

01:44.700 --> 01:45.289
I'm here!

01:45.860 --> 01:46.740
Don't run.

02:01.690 --> 02:05.490
♫How many rain seasons and rains do I need to see♫

02:03.860 --> 02:04.540
If I wake up,

02:05.490 --> 02:08.080
♫Before meeting you♫

02:06.380 --> 02:07.980
I'm not gonna see you again.

02:09.460 --> 02:10.020
No.

02:09.830 --> 02:13.850
♫I am destined to sink to the bottom of the sea♫

02:12.210 --> 02:13.020
Because...

02:13.850 --> 02:16.780
♫You come to my mind♫

02:14.260 --> 02:15.940
Is Luo Ge you, too?

02:17.340 --> 02:18.180
Lu Li is me.

02:17.940 --> 02:21.010
♫But this moment, you believe♫

02:19.500 --> 02:20.579
Luo Ge is me, too.

02:21.010 --> 02:25.030
♫You are my only one. Don't hesitate♫

02:22.420 --> 02:23.420
Wherever you are,

02:24.340 --> 02:25.140
I'll be there.

02:26.120 --> 02:28.990
♫Flowers fly after the rain♫

02:29.310 --> 02:32.360
♫I stay there♫

02:33.010 --> 02:34.380
This is the Lu Li on earth.

02:34.340 --> 02:38.570
♫I say I miss you. Because of your name♫

02:38.740 --> 02:42.290
♫The rest of my life is all about you♫

02:42.780 --> 02:45.360
♫I can't tell if it is dream♫

02:45.740 --> 02:49.850
♫After the flower blossoms, let the love go on♫

02:50.810 --> 02:54.910
♫I say I miss you. Don't doubt it♫

02:55.100 --> 02:58.770
♫You exist in my life♫

02:59.110 --> 03:02.090
♫I want to stay with you♫

03:02.090 --> 03:08.780
♫After the spring and the winter, let the love go on♫

03:24.980 --> 03:27.240
So when I went through my ordeal on earth,

03:27.500 --> 03:28.829
the person I met was you.

03:32.100 --> 03:33.100
You admitted that

03:34.540 --> 03:35.740
you're Lu Li?

03:40.780 --> 03:41.440
You just...

03:41.700 --> 03:42.860
forgot, right?

03:51.300 --> 03:52.700
I don't need to remember.

03:53.579 --> 03:55.620
Whatever I have experienced on earth, people or things,

03:55.620 --> 03:56.500
or false love,

03:58.220 --> 03:59.550
are just doom and gloom.

04:00.060 --> 04:00.990
Since it's doom,

04:01.940 --> 04:03.540
there's no need to look back.

04:05.580 --> 04:06.640
I don't believe it.

04:08.610 --> 04:09.810
You don't believe it?

04:10.700 --> 04:12.460
Even if Lu Li did die,

04:14.290 --> 04:15.380
even if his death

04:17.140 --> 04:19.540
was so painful that it made the heart bleed,

04:20.019 --> 04:22.140
I would like to look back on

04:22.620 --> 04:24.820
my experience with him a million times.

04:25.940 --> 04:27.540
Without these experiences,

04:28.770 --> 04:29.700
my life

04:30.740 --> 04:32.540
would have been pale and boring.

04:36.260 --> 04:37.260
And the best thing

04:38.220 --> 04:39.550
that ever happened to me

04:40.140 --> 04:41.300
was that I met him.

04:42.060 --> 04:44.060
Mortals are ridiculously fragile.

04:44.620 --> 04:46.350
It's because of this obsession

04:47.050 --> 04:50.110
that you're trapped in your dreams by Luo Ning's scent.

04:52.020 --> 04:53.300
But I'm so happy now.

04:54.580 --> 04:55.240
Because...

04:57.140 --> 04:58.270
you're still alive.

05:02.180 --> 05:02.780
All right.

05:04.460 --> 05:05.180
I'm not him.

05:07.060 --> 05:08.790
I advise you to go with the flow,

05:09.060 --> 05:11.060
and stay away from love, hate, delusion and anger.

05:11.060 --> 05:12.590
Don't waste yourself on me.

05:15.060 --> 05:17.100
People can't stay away from love, hate, delusion and anger.

05:17.100 --> 05:20.160
What's so good about being a clay fairy without a heart?

05:28.540 --> 05:29.380
You're

05:29.980 --> 05:31.380
quite special.

05:32.650 --> 05:33.980
Come to Palace Chonghua

05:34.300 --> 05:35.100
in four hours.

05:47.620 --> 05:48.880
Bai Feng, don't worry.

05:49.050 --> 05:50.060
Within three days,

05:50.060 --> 05:52.120
your internal wounds will be healed.

05:52.210 --> 05:52.659
But

05:52.659 --> 05:53.980
we just became friends.

05:53.980 --> 05:55.020
You're leaving again.

05:55.020 --> 05:55.770
Liu Shao said

05:56.180 --> 05:57.640
Lu Li might still be alive.

05:58.090 --> 05:59.690
I can't just go back to earth.

05:59.860 --> 06:01.060
If you come next time,

06:01.140 --> 06:02.600
we'll get together again.

06:03.540 --> 06:03.940
Okay.

06:04.300 --> 06:05.890
Thank you.

06:08.180 --> 06:09.320
Master.

06:09.740 --> 06:10.940
Who is that?

06:11.380 --> 06:13.710
He seems to be popular with his disciples.

06:13.820 --> 06:15.460
-That's Immortal Luo Ge's master. -You have a good talent.

06:15.460 --> 06:17.460
-Immortal Master Wanwu. -Practice with your heart.

06:17.460 --> 06:20.220
There's a good chance that Immortal Luo Ge will become a god.

06:20.220 --> 06:21.540
Then Immortal Master Wanwu's position

06:21.540 --> 06:22.940
would be very different.

06:23.930 --> 06:25.020
Very different?

06:25.580 --> 06:27.180
Become a god?

06:27.930 --> 06:28.820
General Xie.

06:29.580 --> 06:30.340
Well,

06:30.820 --> 06:32.100
he has

06:32.740 --> 06:33.580
a human face.

06:34.180 --> 06:35.290
I can't believe he broke

06:35.290 --> 06:36.750
a thousand years of rules.

06:38.780 --> 06:39.909
That's ridiculous.

06:40.780 --> 06:43.510
He's the only upper immortal in the Three Realms.

06:48.860 --> 06:50.900
If it hadn't been for the Immortal Palace's compassion,

06:50.900 --> 06:52.620
you wouldn't have stayed to heal.

06:52.620 --> 06:54.300
You're just a mortal.

06:54.860 --> 06:56.700
Don't you dare say that

06:57.020 --> 06:58.420
in Immortal Palace.

06:58.659 --> 06:59.650
Is it reasonable

07:00.020 --> 07:01.950
for you to discredit the Immortal?

07:10.780 --> 07:13.580
-Immortal Master Wanwu. -Immortal Master Wanwu.

07:22.100 --> 07:23.220
How dare you

07:23.220 --> 07:24.550
stand up to General Xie.

07:24.620 --> 07:25.930
Aren't you afraid of death?

07:25.930 --> 07:26.770
All I know is that

07:26.770 --> 07:28.260
the Immortal was born for the Three Realms

07:28.260 --> 07:29.490
and can't be discredited.

07:29.490 --> 07:30.330
Beyond this,

07:30.580 --> 07:32.110
I'm not afraid of anything.

07:33.780 --> 07:34.140
You!

07:38.020 --> 07:38.860
I like

07:39.220 --> 07:40.210
her very much.

07:40.700 --> 07:41.620
She can stay.

07:45.140 --> 07:45.780
But,

07:45.940 --> 07:48.340
you're going to start with my court chores.

07:48.580 --> 07:49.300
Will you?

07:50.700 --> 07:52.180
I will do anything.

08:38.940 --> 08:40.059
I'm finally here.

09:17.500 --> 09:18.620
Oh, no.

09:18.980 --> 09:20.500
To enter the Palace Chonghua,

09:20.500 --> 09:22.030
I have to break a formation?

09:28.140 --> 09:29.060
Formation?

09:29.300 --> 09:29.980
Ge.

09:30.090 --> 09:31.660
What were you thinking?

09:33.700 --> 09:36.060
Since we want to leave her in the Xiyin Mountain,

09:36.060 --> 09:38.590
we must test her patience and understanding.

09:41.860 --> 09:43.260
All we need

09:43.260 --> 09:44.820
is her blood.

09:49.260 --> 09:50.460
Restoring the Four Seasons Monument

09:50.460 --> 09:52.180
and protecting the peace of the Three Realms

09:52.180 --> 09:54.420
are the real compassion for all living beings.

09:54.420 --> 09:56.170
But Liu Shao is one of them.

09:56.780 --> 09:58.040
We should never give up

09:58.860 --> 10:00.140
unless we have to.

10:00.660 --> 10:02.050
Besides, even if we use up Liu Shao's blood,

10:02.050 --> 10:05.110
we may not be able to restore the Four Seasons Monument.

10:05.620 --> 10:07.620
But if she has the skill to break the formation,

10:07.620 --> 10:09.060
I have a plan,

10:10.740 --> 10:12.000
making a blood amulet.

10:13.300 --> 10:14.450
Blood amulet?

10:30.380 --> 10:30.780
Okay.

10:30.940 --> 10:31.450
Okay.

10:32.180 --> 10:32.620
Lu Li.

10:47.060 --> 10:48.520
You still have 15 minutes.

10:52.100 --> 10:52.540
You!

10:57.660 --> 10:58.180
Ouch!

11:00.540 --> 11:01.620
Who...who...who?

11:02.260 --> 11:03.140
Who...who...who?

11:03.140 --> 11:04.540
Who dares to beard the lion in his den?

11:04.540 --> 11:04.980
Gosh,

11:05.460 --> 11:06.180
Liu Shao!

11:06.220 --> 11:07.300
Master!

11:07.580 --> 11:08.910
What are you doing here?

11:08.980 --> 11:09.500
I...

11:11.740 --> 11:13.490
So many things have happened.

11:13.780 --> 11:15.860
The Four Seasons Monument changed because of you?

11:15.860 --> 11:16.820
The new Immortal

11:16.820 --> 11:17.860
is Lu Li?

11:19.570 --> 11:21.300
I think he's Lu Li.

11:22.380 --> 11:23.140
But...

11:23.770 --> 11:24.900
He's not like Lu Li.

11:26.300 --> 11:27.700
Lu Li wouldn't do it to me,

11:27.860 --> 11:29.860
and he wouldn't do it to anyone else.

11:30.500 --> 11:32.960
So he went to earth to experience hardships?

11:33.100 --> 11:34.980
Now he has no earthly memory.

11:35.820 --> 11:36.880
He didn't know you,

11:37.060 --> 11:38.780
so he gave you the cold shoulder.

11:38.780 --> 11:40.500
But it's old wine in a new bottle.

11:40.500 --> 11:41.900
The flowers and leaves are replaced but the roots remain the same.

11:41.900 --> 11:43.100
Isn't he the same guy?

11:44.060 --> 11:44.740
Girl.

11:45.140 --> 11:45.900
Lu Li

11:46.100 --> 11:48.430
is the one who holds you close to his heart.

11:49.300 --> 11:51.960
It's not something you can give up if you want to.

11:52.860 --> 11:54.050
Even if he wants to,

11:54.100 --> 11:55.580
I won't let him give up.

11:57.540 --> 11:58.900
Isn't Lu Li him?

11:59.060 --> 11:59.620
Anyway.

11:59.900 --> 12:00.980
What we said before

12:01.140 --> 12:02.100
doesn't count?

12:03.780 --> 12:05.900
I will definitely make him like me again,

12:05.900 --> 12:08.660
at least he can remember me again.

12:09.810 --> 12:11.420
That's the Liu Shao I know.

12:13.620 --> 12:15.690
Palace Chonghua is close at hand.

12:16.090 --> 12:18.090
I don't believe I can't get through.

12:18.100 --> 12:18.900
That's right.

12:19.260 --> 12:21.260
The mutated Five-Element Formation

12:21.260 --> 12:23.190
is also a Five-Element Formation.

12:23.500 --> 12:24.340
Yes.

12:24.660 --> 12:25.420
I'm sure

12:25.540 --> 12:27.200
you can break this formation.

12:28.620 --> 12:29.330
Remember,

12:29.660 --> 12:31.920
Lu Li's formation was taught by Lu Sheng.

12:32.260 --> 12:34.060
I've only learned a little,

12:34.700 --> 12:35.460
but,

12:35.980 --> 12:36.860
it's enough.

12:46.540 --> 12:48.450
Five pillars are based on wood.

12:49.020 --> 12:49.780
Therefore,

12:50.020 --> 12:52.100
this five elements formation is centered on wood.

12:52.100 --> 12:53.700
I used fire to restrain gold,

12:56.420 --> 12:58.150
but it was restrained by water.

12:58.260 --> 12:58.980
I can

12:59.380 --> 13:00.780
use wood to release water

13:05.180 --> 13:06.060
to make a fire.

13:10.090 --> 13:10.690
In the end,

13:11.260 --> 13:12.340
I used wood as a constraint.

13:12.340 --> 13:13.620
Earth grew with gold.

13:19.540 --> 13:21.220
Water and earth are disconnected.

13:21.220 --> 13:23.080
The fire can fetch gold directly.

13:23.330 --> 13:25.330
How is this formation gonna stop me?

13:26.290 --> 13:26.860
Let's go.

13:30.420 --> 13:31.940
I came here on time.

13:31.940 --> 13:32.700
Immortal!

13:33.650 --> 13:34.660
Is it okay to do this?

13:34.660 --> 13:35.140
Yes.

13:37.260 --> 13:38.180
Immortal!

13:39.260 --> 13:41.260
I came here on time.

13:42.260 --> 13:43.460
We're coming in.

13:44.370 --> 13:45.700
Why is there no one here?

13:46.380 --> 13:47.340
Immortal!

13:49.260 --> 13:51.340
Immortal, are you there?

13:51.860 --> 13:52.770
I think

13:53.460 --> 13:55.820
he's hiding

13:55.900 --> 13:57.660
because he saw you fall and didn't picked you up.

13:57.660 --> 13:59.020
You think too much.

13:59.980 --> 14:00.460
Girl.

14:00.620 --> 14:01.460
What is it?

14:04.420 --> 14:06.420
Why does this tree grow upside down?

14:06.660 --> 14:07.860
Where is its roots?

14:08.660 --> 14:10.950
How much better can a tree be when it's off the ground?

14:10.950 --> 14:11.890
It's all alone.

14:12.340 --> 14:12.980
Girl,

14:13.060 --> 14:13.790
do me a favor.

14:15.020 --> 14:16.660
Water this dude.

14:17.980 --> 14:19.510
This is Immortal's palace.

14:19.540 --> 14:20.300
I dare not.

14:20.380 --> 14:21.300
Take it back.

14:22.260 --> 14:24.060
If you take good care of the tree,

14:24.100 --> 14:25.160
he won't blame you.

14:25.180 --> 14:26.660
Listen to me. It can't be wrong.

14:26.660 --> 14:27.340
Really?

14:28.660 --> 14:29.220
Okay.

14:50.260 --> 14:51.380
Im... Im...Immortal.

14:51.380 --> 14:54.020
We... we have no other intention.

14:54.020 --> 14:56.460
We just want to water the tree.

15:00.780 --> 15:02.040
This is Xuan Ling Wood.

15:02.220 --> 15:04.140
It's nourished by the immortal power.

15:04.140 --> 15:05.740
It doesn't need rain and dew.

15:06.500 --> 15:07.380
Of course,

15:08.260 --> 15:09.990
it doesn't need your watering.

15:22.180 --> 15:23.530
You're the new gardener

15:24.340 --> 15:25.600
of the Xiyin Mountain?

15:26.580 --> 15:28.020
You really are Lu Li.

15:37.700 --> 15:40.100
The willows of Xiyin Mountain have been dead for a hundred years.

15:40.100 --> 15:41.740
But because of you,

15:42.300 --> 15:43.560
they came back to life.

15:43.820 --> 15:45.100
Thank you.

15:45.460 --> 15:46.390
You're welcome.

15:46.650 --> 15:47.660
Planting trees and flowers

15:47.660 --> 15:48.580
is my favorite.

15:50.420 --> 15:51.660
Please take care of

15:52.580 --> 15:53.780
the flowers and trees of the Xiyin Mountain.

15:53.780 --> 15:54.940
No problem.

15:55.860 --> 15:57.190
Would you please leave?

15:57.620 --> 15:59.550
I have something to say to Liu Shao.

16:01.660 --> 16:02.460
Go, go, go.

16:02.780 --> 16:03.340
Go.

16:17.660 --> 16:19.540
Immortal,

16:19.900 --> 16:21.500
what do you want me to do here?

16:21.980 --> 16:23.180
You have Sun's power.

16:24.420 --> 16:26.860
The blood in you can repair the Four Seasons Monument.

16:26.860 --> 16:28.060
You know that, right?

16:29.380 --> 16:30.540
I didn't know this before.

16:30.540 --> 16:31.940
Now I know.

16:34.300 --> 16:34.940
So?

16:35.740 --> 16:37.540
Are you going to drain my blood

16:38.100 --> 16:40.160
to repair the Four Seasons Monument?

16:42.380 --> 16:43.980
Even if I drained your blood,

16:44.860 --> 16:46.660
it may not be enough to repair it.

16:50.140 --> 16:50.860
So?

16:52.380 --> 16:54.580
I'm going to plant a blood amulet on you,

16:55.460 --> 16:57.420
using your blood and energy

16:58.140 --> 16:59.670
to make the talisman pearl.

17:00.180 --> 17:01.980
And then I'll take out the talisman pearl

17:01.980 --> 17:04.040
to repair the Four Seasons Monument.

17:04.099 --> 17:06.579
Would that have any effect on my body?

17:09.180 --> 17:11.380
It doesn't matter to take one or two out.

17:11.900 --> 17:15.030
If you take out four or five, you're going to be very weak.

17:15.099 --> 17:16.230
If we take seven out,

17:17.010 --> 17:20.270
the restoration of Four Seasons Monument will be assured.

17:20.819 --> 17:21.500
But you...

17:23.500 --> 17:24.780
will die.

17:28.180 --> 17:28.640
Well...

17:29.060 --> 17:30.540
How many do you need?

17:33.060 --> 17:33.940
Well.

17:34.300 --> 17:37.900
I can't decide until I see how effective the talisman pearls are.

17:38.260 --> 17:39.580
If it doesn't work,

17:40.330 --> 17:42.020
you'd really take seven out

17:42.300 --> 17:44.580
and kill me?

17:46.060 --> 17:47.140
You can disagree.

17:51.890 --> 17:54.690
But if the Four Seasons Monument is ever in danger,

17:55.340 --> 17:57.570
you'll be sacrificed for blood.

17:57.940 --> 18:00.070
And you'll have no chance of survival.

18:04.900 --> 18:06.340
This is

18:07.860 --> 18:09.020
your compassion?

18:10.220 --> 18:12.750
I pity all beings, but you are only one of them.

18:13.260 --> 18:14.740
If you are lucky enough,

18:14.980 --> 18:17.440
one day you'll get the talisman pearls back.

18:17.740 --> 18:19.340
And you'll be as good as ever.

18:21.900 --> 18:23.940
It seems I have to say yes.

18:24.450 --> 18:25.910
Then promise me one thing.

18:29.500 --> 18:30.100
What is it?

18:30.260 --> 18:31.420
Your palace

18:31.660 --> 18:32.780
won't stop me.

18:32.940 --> 18:34.470
I can come and go as I please.

18:35.660 --> 18:37.120
I know you like to be quiet.

18:37.660 --> 18:40.260
But if you want to make me into talisman pearls,

18:40.260 --> 18:42.900
I'm afraid my days here are numbered.

18:44.740 --> 18:45.300
Okay.

18:46.220 --> 18:47.020
I promise you.

18:47.940 --> 18:49.420
But you must abide by

18:50.700 --> 18:51.780
my rules.

18:53.250 --> 18:54.260
Please go ahead.

19:06.020 --> 19:08.020
There are three things you can't do.

19:08.220 --> 19:08.780
First,

19:10.020 --> 19:11.820
Xuan Ling Wood can't be touched.

19:12.340 --> 19:12.820
Second,

19:14.220 --> 19:15.930
the books in the palace can't be touched.

19:15.930 --> 19:16.570
Third,

19:17.500 --> 19:18.100
and

19:28.900 --> 19:30.180
most important,

19:37.780 --> 19:38.460
I

19:40.300 --> 19:41.300
can't be touched,

19:42.620 --> 19:44.780
even a shadow or a piece of clothing.

19:45.700 --> 19:46.760
Do you understand?

19:48.090 --> 19:50.780
I will follow your rules.

19:51.860 --> 19:54.420
But please promise me one condition.

19:55.420 --> 19:56.100
Go ahead.

19:56.540 --> 19:59.340
Don't blame Luo Ning for the scent in my dream.

20:00.050 --> 20:01.380
It's all my obsession.

20:01.660 --> 20:03.120
She just wanted to help me.

20:04.140 --> 20:04.940
That's all?

20:06.740 --> 20:07.210
Okay.

20:47.900 --> 20:49.580
So many scriptures!

20:49.900 --> 20:51.500
Copy them all?

20:52.740 --> 20:54.100
My brother

20:54.580 --> 20:56.110
told you to bring them to me?

20:57.100 --> 20:58.340
Yes.

20:58.380 --> 21:00.300
He also said this time was different.

21:00.300 --> 21:01.660
You can't copy this book

21:01.850 --> 21:04.050
until you've made the words disappear.

21:18.860 --> 21:20.660
How... How can I

21:20.970 --> 21:23.100
copy out the words from the scripture?

21:25.220 --> 21:26.660
Don't you know how to do magic?

21:26.660 --> 21:27.820
You can cast spells.

21:30.260 --> 21:30.980
Right.

21:31.100 --> 21:32.160
How could I forget?

21:32.220 --> 21:32.620
Okay.

21:32.740 --> 21:33.260
Well.

21:34.410 --> 21:35.140
Let me think.

21:44.940 --> 21:45.940
Try... Try again.

21:46.220 --> 21:47.020
Okay.

21:59.300 --> 22:00.160
It didn't work?

22:00.740 --> 22:02.860
Did Luo Ge ban these books?

22:02.900 --> 22:04.030
Why can't this work?

22:05.220 --> 22:07.020
Or Luo Ning's magic didn't work?

22:09.260 --> 22:10.260
Liu Shao.

22:10.460 --> 22:11.300
How about...

22:11.580 --> 22:13.980
How about you go back and talk to my brother?

22:13.980 --> 22:15.420
Let him think of something else.

22:15.420 --> 22:17.050
He won't listen to me.

22:17.740 --> 22:19.860
But, I can still help you.

22:25.380 --> 22:27.780
Have you seen all these before?

22:28.180 --> 22:29.780
Yes,

22:30.180 --> 22:31.980
and I've copied them many times.

22:32.220 --> 22:33.020
But...

22:33.620 --> 22:35.060
But what good is that?

22:35.330 --> 22:37.220
I'm not interested in them at all.

22:37.620 --> 22:39.420
And I soon forget the content.

22:49.960 --> 22:51.690
Love brings sorrow.

23:04.540 --> 23:05.500
The word is gone.

23:07.290 --> 23:08.180
Yes!

23:08.180 --> 23:09.060
I get it.

23:09.780 --> 23:11.340
Only when the words are really in your heart

23:11.340 --> 23:12.660
will they disappear.

23:14.980 --> 23:15.940
I see.

23:21.420 --> 23:22.500
Liu Shao.

23:24.220 --> 23:24.820
I think

23:24.860 --> 23:26.100
this all seems

23:26.580 --> 23:28.180
pretty easy to you.

23:29.020 --> 23:30.020
How about this?

23:30.180 --> 23:31.620
Do me a favor.

23:31.860 --> 23:33.770
I need you to recite all this for me.

23:33.770 --> 23:35.450
So I can talk to my brother.

23:35.660 --> 23:37.380
Okay? Liu Shao.

23:40.460 --> 23:41.260
Luo Ning.

23:41.420 --> 23:42.700
Do you want

23:42.700 --> 23:45.020
the dew of the King Herb?

23:46.140 --> 23:47.780
The dew of the King Herb?

23:48.180 --> 23:49.260
Yes! Yes!

23:49.530 --> 23:50.740
Tell me where it is.

23:50.860 --> 23:52.540
Okay, but...

23:53.420 --> 23:55.080
You have to memorize it first.

23:57.090 --> 23:57.930
Don't worry.

23:58.020 --> 23:59.080
I'll do it with you.

24:38.660 --> 24:40.170
You... you're done?

24:45.370 --> 24:47.770
[Meditation Spell]

25:08.980 --> 25:11.710
Why did Senior Zhuo come to Xiyin Mountain again?

25:13.900 --> 25:15.940
Master Shang

25:16.140 --> 25:17.740
must have sneaked out again.

25:18.410 --> 25:19.700
Master Shang?

25:20.740 --> 25:21.420
Yes.

25:22.540 --> 25:23.450
Let me tell you.

25:23.900 --> 25:26.300
The master of three palaces, Shang Yurong,

25:27.420 --> 25:28.540
is flashy

25:29.260 --> 25:30.980
and at loose ends all day.

25:31.900 --> 25:32.780
So,

25:32.980 --> 25:34.180
you have to be careful

25:34.860 --> 25:36.120
and stay away from him.

25:37.220 --> 25:39.060
Okay.

25:42.830 --> 25:51.060
[Palace of Abyssal Mirrors]

26:03.740 --> 26:04.580
Let's hurry up.

26:04.580 --> 26:06.300
We'll be waiting at the Litian Temple later.

26:06.300 --> 26:08.300
The canonization of the Immortal is about to begin.

26:08.300 --> 26:09.220
Okay, I get it.

26:10.780 --> 26:11.660
Shang Yurong!

26:12.060 --> 26:12.940
Get out here!

26:16.100 --> 26:16.980
General Zhuo.

26:17.980 --> 26:19.240
Where is Master Shang?

26:19.620 --> 26:21.420
He went out early in the morning.

26:21.780 --> 26:22.500
Did he not know that

26:22.500 --> 26:24.860
the canonization ceremony was to take place this morning?

26:24.860 --> 26:25.980
He's the head of three palaces.

26:25.980 --> 26:27.100
He has to be there.

26:27.700 --> 26:28.940
Yes...yes.

26:29.500 --> 26:30.700
Then why is he hiding?

26:34.420 --> 26:34.900
Go.

26:35.340 --> 26:36.540
Bring me

26:36.540 --> 26:37.780
his favorite dress inlaid with gold silk

26:37.780 --> 26:39.420
and the sea pearl crown.

26:42.780 --> 26:43.580
General Zhuo.

26:48.980 --> 26:50.140
Tell your master

26:50.500 --> 26:51.460
he must be at the Litian Temple

26:51.460 --> 26:53.260
when the auspicious time comes.

26:53.500 --> 26:54.180
Otherwise,

26:54.540 --> 26:55.620
I'm sure

26:55.820 --> 26:58.350
he won't be able to wear a single piece of yarn.

27:42.020 --> 27:43.900
I finally finished memorizing.

27:46.060 --> 27:47.140
Liu Shao.

27:47.580 --> 27:48.860
You're so nice.

27:48.940 --> 27:50.580
I've finally finished memorizing these books.

27:50.580 --> 27:52.140
Thank you.

27:53.900 --> 27:55.500
But if it hadn't been for me,

27:55.540 --> 27:57.420
you wouldn't have been punished by the Immortal.

27:57.420 --> 27:59.340
So it's all about sharing the good

27:59.460 --> 28:00.340
and the bad.

28:01.300 --> 28:02.260
Let's look for the dew.

28:02.260 --> 28:02.790
Let's go.

28:03.020 --> 28:03.500
Wait.

28:04.020 --> 28:04.810
Liu Shao.

28:05.100 --> 28:07.030
I don't want to look for the dew now.

28:07.060 --> 28:09.590
Why don't we go to the Litian Temple together?

28:09.900 --> 28:10.620
Today

28:10.820 --> 28:12.380
is the day of my brother's canonization.

28:12.380 --> 28:13.440
Let's go together.

28:14.660 --> 28:15.860
Luo Ge will be promoted to the Immortal?

28:15.860 --> 28:17.140
Let's go together, okay?

28:17.140 --> 28:18.670
So Lu Li will be an Immortal?

28:32.620 --> 28:33.460
There hasn't been an immortal in thousands of years.

28:33.460 --> 28:34.620
Why isn't Rong here yet?

28:34.620 --> 28:36.880
It's a blessing for the Immortal Palace.

28:40.820 --> 28:41.660
I'm looking forward to it.

28:41.660 --> 28:42.190
Yes.

28:46.620 --> 28:48.780
There's only one immortal in a thousand years,

28:48.780 --> 28:50.440
so the ceremony has to be huge.

29:01.100 --> 29:02.620
The Immortal is about to be canonized.

29:02.620 --> 29:04.020
On such an important day,

29:04.620 --> 29:07.140
as the head of three palaces,

29:07.540 --> 29:09.580
I can't believe Shang Yurong didn't show up.

29:09.580 --> 29:12.440
That would be pretty humiliating for the Immortal.

29:13.660 --> 29:15.900
Master Shang has been so busy practicing recently

29:15.900 --> 29:18.100
that he can't help losing track of time.

29:18.370 --> 29:19.700
The Immortal is coming,

29:20.500 --> 29:22.100
but Master Shang isn't here.

29:23.020 --> 29:24.450
Who will be in charge?

29:26.940 --> 29:27.660
He's right.

29:31.900 --> 29:33.690
Now Luo Ge is an Immortal.

29:34.460 --> 29:35.460
Can Shang Yurong

29:36.860 --> 29:38.580
still sit at the top?

29:39.780 --> 29:41.980
I don't know what you're talking about.

29:43.020 --> 29:44.180
Can't you see that?

29:45.660 --> 29:46.580
Shang Yurong

29:46.740 --> 29:47.700
is no match for

29:48.060 --> 29:49.660
the Immortal.

29:50.930 --> 29:54.060
If it hadn't been for former Master Shang's favoritism,

29:55.260 --> 29:57.220
I'm afraid he wouldn't have been able to maintain

29:57.220 --> 29:58.820
his position as the master of the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors.

29:58.820 --> 30:01.580
Now Shang Yurong is the head of the three palaces,

30:01.980 --> 30:03.500
but he hasn't even learned

30:04.380 --> 30:07.110
the Burning Sea of the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors.

30:12.740 --> 30:14.620
How does this reassure

30:15.930 --> 30:16.900
the dead master?

30:17.740 --> 30:19.400
I advise you to tread lightly.

30:19.420 --> 30:20.660
To criticize the master of the palace

30:20.660 --> 30:22.520
is to violate the immortal rules.

30:23.260 --> 30:24.460
You overreacted.

30:26.450 --> 30:28.140
I don't think I'm breaking the rules

30:28.140 --> 30:29.340
by telling the truth.

30:32.130 --> 30:33.420
I'm just

30:34.260 --> 30:35.980
happy for Luo Ge

30:37.860 --> 30:39.140
because he got promoted.

30:39.140 --> 30:40.600
What are you trying to say?

30:45.820 --> 30:46.540
Everyone,

30:49.700 --> 30:51.980
with Luo Ge's ascension to Immortalhood,

30:51.980 --> 30:54.780
I think the whole Immortal Palace needs to change.

30:55.060 --> 30:55.980
For example,

30:56.940 --> 30:59.400
the position of the head of the three palaces

31:01.100 --> 31:03.230
should be replaced by a competent man.

31:04.100 --> 31:05.460
I won't argue with you

31:05.660 --> 31:07.100
on this day of the Immortal's canonization.

31:07.100 --> 31:08.860
If you don't stop talking like that,

31:08.860 --> 31:10.060
I won't go easy on you.

31:11.100 --> 31:11.740
Oh,

31:12.820 --> 31:14.140
I was right?

31:15.460 --> 31:17.460
You don't want to change the master?

31:20.620 --> 31:21.980
Is that true?

31:22.500 --> 31:23.170
Yes.

31:23.660 --> 31:26.620
The Immortal really should have chosen someone else to be the master.

31:26.620 --> 31:28.210
Otherwise, the millennia of the Immortal Palace's legacy

31:28.210 --> 31:29.340
would be ruined.

31:33.020 --> 31:35.220
The throne of the three palaces is not for you to judge.

31:35.220 --> 31:36.010
Ridiculous!

31:39.540 --> 31:41.000
Then I would like to ask you

31:41.450 --> 31:42.660
where is

31:42.700 --> 31:44.160
Abyssal Mirrors Palace's

31:46.140 --> 31:46.980
noble master?

31:50.190 --> 31:52.370
[Shang Yurong, Master of the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors]

31:57.940 --> 31:58.460
Go!

32:01.380 --> 32:02.100
Luo Ning.

32:07.380 --> 32:10.240
Looks like she took too long memorizing last night.

32:10.890 --> 32:11.700
But this...

32:12.570 --> 32:13.900
What am I supposed to do?

32:19.140 --> 32:20.020
Who are you?

32:20.620 --> 32:23.540
Miss, are you going to the Litian Temple in the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors?

32:23.540 --> 32:24.420
Yes.

32:24.620 --> 32:25.420
I know the way.

32:25.420 --> 32:26.550
I'll take you there.

32:26.580 --> 32:28.060
But I don't even know who you are.

32:28.060 --> 32:29.320
What does that matter?

32:30.010 --> 32:31.610
This is the Immortal Palace,

32:31.780 --> 32:33.570
the most peaceful and boring place in the world.

32:33.570 --> 32:35.050
And I'm so well-dressed.

32:35.180 --> 32:36.640
I'm not a bad person, okay?

32:39.420 --> 32:40.060
All right.

32:40.290 --> 32:41.620
Thank you.

32:42.700 --> 32:43.300
By the way,

32:43.450 --> 32:44.860
you don't seem to know how to sail.

32:44.860 --> 32:45.790
Let me teach you.

32:46.170 --> 32:46.700
Okay.

32:49.620 --> 32:50.380
That will do.

32:57.700 --> 33:00.050
Yes, that's it. Not bad.

33:02.300 --> 33:04.230
You go a little further to the left.

33:05.220 --> 33:06.570
A little more to the left.

33:06.570 --> 33:07.970
A little more to the left.

33:08.060 --> 33:08.660
No, no, no.

33:08.780 --> 33:09.510
To the right.

33:16.220 --> 33:16.780
Okay.

33:17.220 --> 33:18.020
Yes, yes, yes.

33:18.100 --> 33:18.700
That's it.

33:18.900 --> 33:19.700
Yes, yes.

33:20.700 --> 33:21.460
To the left.

33:22.980 --> 33:23.460
Left.

33:25.900 --> 33:26.380
You!

33:27.100 --> 33:28.460
Shang Yurong!

33:28.940 --> 33:30.930
Don't you dare tell us what to do.

33:31.140 --> 33:32.940
I'll go to the Palace Wuxie

33:33.020 --> 33:34.180
and tell your Senior Zhuo.

33:34.180 --> 33:35.620
Ning, you woke up just in time.

33:35.620 --> 33:36.550
Here, look at me.

33:47.130 --> 33:48.530
Is such a beautiful scene

33:48.620 --> 33:50.620
a perfect match

33:50.660 --> 33:52.920
for my gorgeous golden feather garment?

33:54.180 --> 33:54.980
So,

33:55.140 --> 33:56.900
you kept telling me to adjust the angle

33:56.900 --> 33:58.100
to suit

33:58.420 --> 34:00.220
your outfit?

34:00.820 --> 34:01.500
Yes.

34:02.300 --> 34:03.340
What?

34:03.540 --> 34:04.570
You've gone too far.

34:04.570 --> 34:06.630
I'm gonna go back and tell my brother.

34:06.980 --> 34:09.460
The Palace of Abyssal Mirrors is the head of the three immortal palaces.

34:09.460 --> 34:10.300
And I'm the master.

34:10.300 --> 34:12.030
I'm not afraid of your brother.

34:13.139 --> 34:14.020
Liu Shao.

34:14.580 --> 34:15.980
What you don't know is that

34:15.980 --> 34:16.860
this guy

34:16.860 --> 34:19.460
has been practicing the Burning Sea for 500 years

34:19.460 --> 34:21.170
without success,

34:22.139 --> 34:23.739
which got his Senior Zhuo

34:23.739 --> 34:25.219
ridiculed by Xie Lingqi.

34:25.460 --> 34:26.739
Don't you dare compare yourself to my brother.

34:26.739 --> 34:28.139
What? Xie Lingqi?

34:28.260 --> 34:30.320
He dared to laugh at my senior sister?

34:30.409 --> 34:31.449
I wonder if the ceremony is about to begin?

34:31.449 --> 34:32.460
Will we be late?

34:33.580 --> 34:34.900
No, no.

34:39.380 --> 34:40.179
Ignore him.

34:43.780 --> 34:44.440
Have a seat.

34:53.380 --> 34:55.739
Master Shang is too busy practicing

34:55.980 --> 34:56.940
to come here.

34:58.130 --> 35:00.860
On behalf of the master, I'd like to propose a toast to you.

35:00.860 --> 35:02.720
May God bless the Abyssal Mirror.

35:03.340 --> 35:05.400
Who said Master Shang wasn't coming?

35:09.100 --> 35:10.100
Immortal Master.

35:12.580 --> 35:14.540
Master Shang told me that

35:14.980 --> 35:17.340
since three palaces wanted to congratulate the Immortal,

35:17.340 --> 35:18.180
the gift

35:18.300 --> 35:21.020
should be shared by three palaces.

35:22.340 --> 35:24.700
Sister Zhuo, please open this box first.

35:45.410 --> 35:46.580
Why is she here?

35:46.580 --> 35:47.260
It's inappropriate, isn't it?

35:47.260 --> 35:49.860
I can't believe she showed up at this big event.

35:50.300 --> 35:51.100
General Xie.

35:51.340 --> 35:53.460
Please read out the words on the scroll

35:53.460 --> 35:55.320
so that the ceremony is complete.

35:57.740 --> 35:58.540
Why me?

35:59.620 --> 36:01.580
It's Master Shang's request.

36:01.660 --> 36:02.300
Well,

36:02.740 --> 36:03.600
can't you read?

36:04.220 --> 36:04.740
I...

36:18.820 --> 36:19.620
Immortal

36:20.260 --> 36:21.020
Shang

36:21.460 --> 36:22.180
Yu

36:22.820 --> 36:23.740
Rong

36:24.020 --> 36:25.340
arrives.

36:58.020 --> 36:59.780
I, Shang Yurong, the head of three palaces,

36:59.780 --> 37:01.260
led the Immortal Palace

37:02.100 --> 37:03.420
to greet Immortal.

37:04.540 --> 37:07.020
Immortal.

37:17.940 --> 37:19.660
I'm from Xiyin Mountain.

37:20.420 --> 37:23.900
She's the one I need to protect.

37:41.900 --> 37:43.260
Congratulations, Immortal.

37:43.260 --> 37:44.570
Your body is glassy

37:44.570 --> 37:45.940
inside and out.

37:46.420 --> 37:47.780
You demonstrate your ideas by acting on them.

37:47.780 --> 37:49.380
We are clean together.

37:52.540 --> 37:54.210
Congratulations on your promotion.

37:54.210 --> 37:56.670
From now on, your grace is all over the world.

37:58.140 --> 38:00.620
The Three Realms are at ease.

38:10.900 --> 38:12.140
I, Luo Ge,

38:13.420 --> 38:15.220
wish to benefit the Three Realms

38:15.650 --> 38:16.700
and the people.

38:18.170 --> 38:20.300
I would like to be the way to all beings.

38:21.500 --> 38:23.300
I would like to give all

38:24.380 --> 38:28.060
in exchange for the clarity of the world.

38:28.060 --> 38:28.890
Yes.

38:44.100 --> 38:45.020
This is my senior.

38:45.020 --> 38:46.750
She is in charge of Palace Wuji,

38:46.820 --> 38:47.980
responsible for the rules and regulations.

38:47.980 --> 38:50.780
The Thunder Whip in her hand is for evil creatures.

38:52.620 --> 38:54.100
This is Immortal Wanwu, the Master of Palace Wuji,

38:54.100 --> 38:56.340
responsible for the suppression of evil and expeditions.

38:56.340 --> 38:57.180
As for

38:57.180 --> 38:58.420
the other affairs of the Immortal Palace,

38:58.420 --> 39:00.460
the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors is in charge.

39:00.460 --> 39:01.380
So

39:01.380 --> 39:03.500
the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors is the head of the three palaces?

39:03.500 --> 39:04.210
Smart.

39:08.780 --> 39:10.900
What about Palace Chonghua?

39:12.300 --> 39:14.100
The three palaces do not include Palace Chonghua.

39:14.100 --> 39:15.380
Luo Ge devoted himself to practice

39:15.380 --> 39:16.710
and became an immortal.

39:16.860 --> 39:17.700
Of course, Palace Chonghua

39:17.700 --> 39:18.960
is more otherworldly.

39:19.900 --> 39:20.500
Come here.

39:27.340 --> 39:28.540
Get up, get up, get up.

39:28.780 --> 39:29.380
Behind.

39:30.050 --> 39:30.380
Have a seat.

39:30.380 --> 39:31.300
Me? Can I?

39:32.700 --> 39:33.380
Yes.

39:33.940 --> 39:34.470
Sit down.

39:35.300 --> 39:36.860
I don't think it's appropriate.

39:36.860 --> 39:38.190
What's wrong with this?

39:39.060 --> 39:40.990
I don't think that's appropriate.

39:41.580 --> 39:43.440
This is the feast of the Immortal.

39:44.180 --> 39:45.620
She's just a mortal.

39:46.580 --> 39:48.040
What qualifies her to sit?

39:48.780 --> 39:49.460
Sit down.

39:51.380 --> 39:51.980
Well,

39:52.420 --> 39:53.420
if Liu Shao wants,

39:53.580 --> 39:55.260
she can be my wife.

39:57.180 --> 39:58.210
Shang Yurong!

39:58.340 --> 39:59.820
Do you know what you are saying?

39:59.820 --> 40:01.950
There has to be a limit to willfulness.

40:04.980 --> 40:05.540
Sit down.

40:12.420 --> 40:13.260
I don't care

40:13.500 --> 40:15.100
if she's mortal or immortal.

40:15.700 --> 40:16.660
All I know is that

40:16.890 --> 40:19.180
Liu Shao has promised to use herself to make the blood amulet

40:19.180 --> 40:21.100
to repair the Four Seasons Monument.

40:21.100 --> 40:22.820
I want to ask who in this room

40:23.500 --> 40:24.890
can do that.

40:42.300 --> 40:45.100
Tomorrow I'll lay out a magic circle on Lusitai

40:46.060 --> 40:47.500
and use Liu Shao's body

40:47.820 --> 40:49.020
for the blood amulet.

40:51.660 --> 40:52.980
I'm willing to help you

40:53.260 --> 40:54.660
defend the magic circle.

40:55.420 --> 40:56.100
No need.

40:57.540 --> 40:59.620
Disciples of the Three Immortal Palaces

40:59.620 --> 41:01.180
are not allowed to go near Lusitai

41:01.180 --> 41:02.500
for three days.

41:05.450 --> 41:06.340
Yes.
